  "engineering_notes": [
    "Curbs are low walkable pavement edges; green garden material is walkable unless bounded by listed walls/buildings.",
    "All visible buildings, perimeter wall segments, truck and barrel pair have solid footprints. Full projected building bboxes are conservative to keep baked background architecture in front of the player.",
    "Shared roofs/plaster/frames/slats retain their material; complete doors, canopy ends, garage jambs and church are never approximated by similar tiles.",
    "RGBA truck/barrels composited in RGB against actual ground before nearest palette conversion, avoiding palette-index alpha interpolation.",
    "Camera views are composed native previews with existing hero sprite, not emulator screenshots; runtime confirmation belongs to root."
  ],
  "critical_review": {
    "improvements": [
      "Street bends around north/south parcels; church plaza, market block, workshop and arrival forecourt are distinct spaces.",
      "South facades retain their full base; all six principal buildings have complete legal camera previews.",
      "Church is pixel-identical in both conditions; no roof/bush crop replacement."
    ],
    "limitations": [
      "Repeated roof grammar and quiet flat road are deliberate memory tradeoffs; independent visual reviewer must decide whether parcel rhythm remains too regular.",
      "Damaged bank uses all640tiles, leaving no room for additional background art.",
      "Whole-scene source is decomposed into shared architectural materials and complete openings; final native panorama is not a literal downscale of the source."
    ]
  },
